"HIGHLIGHTS OF PRESCRIBING INFORMATION These highlights do not include all the information needed to use anastrozole tablets safely and effectively. See full prescribing information for anastrozole tablets. Initial U.S. Approval (https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/getFile.cfm?setid=1448e72e-dc7f-4618-9b37-a82c59823839&type=pdf)\nciteturn1search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 10.5 years ago; Crawled: 3 months ago; • yellowing of the skin or whites of the eyes ... • hot flashes ... 346033\n• yellowing of the skin or whites of the eyes  \n• pain on the right side of your abdomen  \n\nCommon side effects in women taking anastrozole tablets include:  \n• hot flashes  \n• weakness  \n• joint pain  \n• carpal tunnel syndrome (tingling, pain, coldness, weakness in parts of the hand)  \n• pain  \n• sore throat  \n• mood changes  \n• high blood pressure  \n• depression  \n• nausea and vomiting  \n• thinning of the hair (hair loss)  \n• rash  \n• back pain  \n• sleep problems  \n• bone pain  \n• headache  \n• swelling  \n• increased cough  \n• shortness of breath  \n• lymphedema (build up of lymph fluid in the tissues of your affected arm)  \n• trigger finger (a condition in which one of your fingers or your thumb catches in a bent position)  \n\nHOW SHOULD I STORE ANASTROZOLE TABLETS?  \n• Store anastrozole tablets at 68°F to 77°F (20°C to 25°C).  \n• Keep anastrozole tablets and all medicines out of the reach of children.  \n\nGeneral information about anastrozole tablets.  \nMedicines are sometimes prescribed for conditions that are not mentioned in patient information leaflets. Do not take anastrozole tablets for a condition for which it was not prescribed. Do not give anastrozole tablets to other people, even if they have the same symptoms you have. It may harm them.  \nThis patient information leaflet summarizes the most important information about anastrozole tablets. If you would like more information, talk with your doctor. You can ask your pharmacist or doctor for information about anastrozole tablets that is written for health professionals.  \n\nWhat are the ingredients in anastrozole tablets?  \nActive ingredient: anastrozole  \nInactive ingredients: lactose monohydrate, magnesium stearate, hypromellose, polyethylene glycol, povidone, sodium starch glycolate and titanium dioxide.  \n\nManufactured by:  \nNatco Pharma Limited  \nKothur – 509 228. A.P. India.  \n\nMfd for:  \nAscend Laboratories, LLC  \nMontvale, NJ 07645  \n\n346033--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nՔիմ Քարդաշյանը հեծանիվ վարելիս ընկել է (Photo) - BlogNews.am (https://blognews.am/arm/news/150286/qim-qardashyany-hetsaniv-varelis-ynkel-e-photo.html)\nciteturn1search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: 12.6 years ago; Crawled: 2 months ago; ##### Hot TV ... Նյութի աղբյուր՝ http://www.hottv.am/people/346033\n\n  * # Քիմ Քարդաշյանը հեծանիվ վարելիս ընկել է (Photo)\n\n##### Hot TV\n\nevent_note15:30 , 16 ապրիլ 2014 visibility 9850 commentմեկնաբանել\n\nImage\n\n«Էներգետիկ ըմպելիքի գովազդի նկարահանման ժամանակ Քիմ Քարդաշյանը ցանկացել է նմանվել Օդրի Հեփբերնին, սակայն դա նրա վրա թանկ է նստել»,- գրում է Dailymail-ը: Ռեալթիթի շոուի աստղը հեծանիվից վայր է ընկել՝ հայտնվելով անհարմար իրավիճակում:\n\nImage\n\nImage: article-0-1D234A9B00000578-473_634x528\n\nImage: article-0-1D234A9700000578-437_634x371\n\nImage: article-2605785-1D234A3700000578-760_634x748\n\nՆյութի աղբյուր՝ http://www.hottv.am/people/346033--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nChicken Pasta Salad Recipe By Mike (https://cookpad.com/eng/recipes/346033)\nciteturn1search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 11.8 years ago; Crawled: 4 months ago; (great cold or hot) ... (great cold or hot) ...   * 2 -3 boneless chicken breast or tenderloins ... Recipe ID: 346033\n\n# Chicken Pasta Salad\n\nMike @cook_2785692\n\n...came up with this idea as a healthy, quick on-the-go snack...\n(great cold or hot)\n\n[Button: Read more]\n\n...came up with this idea as a healthy, quick on-the-go snack...\n(great cold or hot)\n\nRead more\n\n# Chicken Pasta Salad\n\nMike @cook_2785692\n\n...came up with this idea as a healthy, quick on-the-go snack...\n(great cold or hot)\n\n\n## Ingredients\n\n35 mins\n\n8 servings\n\n  * 2 -3 boneless chicken breast or tenderloins\n  * 1 -2 whole ripe tomatoes\n  * 1 whole cucumber (peeled if you prefer)\n  * 2 cup favorite pasta\n  * 1 cup your favorite vinaigrette or light Italian dressing\n  * 1 tsp black pepper\n  * 1/2 cup shredded carrots\n\n\n## Steps\n\n35 mins\n\n  1. 1\n\ngrill chicken with desired seasoning to taste\n\n  2. 2\n\ndice chicken into bite-sized peices\n\n  3. 3\n\nboil pasta until tender, then rinse with cold water to keep firm\n\n  4. 4\n\ndice tomatoes & cucumber\n\n  5. 5\n\nmix all ingredients in a moderate size bowl\n\n  6. 6\n\nmarinate with vinaigrette or dressing\n\n  7. 7\n\nmix sparingly and serve!! (hot or cold)\n\nRecipe ID: 346033\n\nMike @cook_2785692\n\non January 16, 2015 21:03\n\n[Input][Button: Following]\n\nFollow Back Follow\n\nPersonal Trainer, Nutritionist, I/T specialist & totally domesticated...I just really enjoy cooking...lol\n\n\n## Keywords\n\nPasta Salad Cucumber Chicken Breast Pepper Carrot Tomato--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInstitute of Mathematics / Talks (https://www.mat.tu-harburg.de/veranstaltungen/vortraege/vortraege_en.php?show_all=1)\nciteturn1search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; 12/06/18  | 10:00 am  | Am Schwarzenberg-Campus 3 (E), Room 3.074  | Hot spots of quantum graphs ... In this talk we will examine the corresponding question on metric graphs: for the Laplacian on a finite metric graph with standard (continuity and Kirchhoff) vertex conditions we consider the possible distribution of maxima and minima of eigenfunctions associated with the smallest nonzero eigenvalue.\n12/06/18  | 10:00 am  | Am Schwarzenberg-Campus 3 (E), Room 3.074  | Hot spots of quantum graphs\nJonathan Rohleder, Matematiska institutionen, Stockholms universitet The Hot Spots Conjecture of J. Rauch asserts that the hottest and coldest points of an insulated body should move towards its boundary for large times, if the insulation is perfect. Via the semigroup associated with the Neumann Laplacian this reduces to proving that maximum and minimum of the eigenfunction(s) associated with the smallest positive eigenvalue are located on the boundary. This conjecture is not true in full generality but is currently open, for example, for convex domains.\nIn this talk we will examine the corresponding question on metric graphs: for the Laplacian on a finite metric graph with standard (continuity and Kirchhoff) vertex conditions we consider the possible distribution of maxima and minima of eigenfunctions associated with the smallest nonzero eigenvalue. Among other things, we give examples to show that the usual notion of “boundary” of a metric graph, namely the set of vertices of degree one, has limited relevance for determining the “hottest” and “coldest” parts of a graph.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\ncsv_export_products (6) (https://spinningline.ru/uploads/files/10000%20%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%20%D0%98%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BB%D1%8E%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F.pdf)\nciteturn1search13 [wordlim: 200] Blade Tandem №3/№5 10гр Hot Pike</td></tr> ... <tr><td>346033</td><td>Smith</td><td>Блесна Smith Pure 2,7гр S09</td></tr>\n<tr><td>156373</td><td>Smith</td><td>Блесна Smith AR-Spinner Trout Model 3,5гр 14</td></tr>\n<tr><td>345731</td><td>Smith</td><td>Блесна Smith AR-Spinner Trout Model 6гр 04</td></tr>\n<tr><td>346026</td><td>Smith</td><td>Блесна Smith Pure 2,7гр 52</td></tr>\n<tr><td>346033</td><td>Smith</td><td>Блесна Smith Pure 2,7гр S09</td></tr>\n<tr><td>346045</td><td>Smith</td><td>Блесна Smith Pure 3,5гр 58</td></tr>\n<tr><td>534637</td><td>Spike</td><td>Блесна Spike Академик 24гр 01</td